Z||000000||firstfiero||12-17-2000||11:15 AM||||    Well we did the what cars do you own but how bout the cars that you've had that you miss or you wished you hadn't sold or hadn't wrecked....here's mine.    77 porshe 924...had a blown engine when I bought it. sold it because I got a divorce and couldn't afford to have the electrical problems fixed. 80 bmw 528i....looks like no other bimmer on the road and drove like a dream....unfortunatly had alot of rust underneath and had to go. 92 geo storm gsi..I know I know it's a geo but I did really like the way it looked. The fiero is going to be a classic! I'm not letting this one go.     92se<P>                 ||||reg||6
